						SetPlayerPos(playerid, slx, sly, slz + 2.5 ) ;
						ApplyAnimation(playerid, "ped", "getup", 4.0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0,0 ) ;
					}
				}
			}
		}

		new pl_state = GetPlayerState ( playerid ) ;
		if ( get_speed ( playerid ) > 600 )return anti_cheat ( playerid, "AirBreak", 123 ) ;
		if ( pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT && get_speed ( playerid ) > 250 )return anti_cheat ( playerid, "surf", 124 ) ;
		if ( pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_PASSENGER && ( GetPlayerWeapon( playerid ) == 24 || GetPlayerWeapon( playerid ) == 25 ) ) SetPlayerArmedWeapon ( playerid, 0 ) ;

		new Float: now_health,
			Float: now_armour ;

		GetPlayerHealth ( playerid, now_health ) ;
		GetPlayerArmour ( playerid, now_armour ) ;

		if ( now_health > p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_health ] )set_health ( playerid, p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_health ] ) ;
		if ( now_armour > p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_armour ] )set_armour ( playerid, p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_armour ] ) ;

		new _dialog = p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_dialog ] ;
		if ( ( _dialog == d_rent_car || _dialog == d_carmarket_buy ) && get_speed ( playerid ) > 20 )anti_cheat ( playerid, "dialog hider", 79 ) ;
		if ( _dialog == d_googleauth_entrance && get_speed ( playerid ) > 5 &&  p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_tp_immune_time ] == 0 ) anti_cheat ( playerid, "dialog hider", 78 ) ;

		/*new anim = GetPlayerAnimationIndex ( playerid ) ;
		new animlib [ 24 ], animname [ 24 ] ;
		GetAnimationName ( anim, animlib, sizeof(animlib), animname, sizeof(animname)) ;
		if ( strcmp(animlib, "SWIM", true ) == 0 && strcmp ( animname, "SWIM_crawl", true ) == 0 && ! not_flying ( playerid ) )
		{
			if ( get_speed ( playerid ) > 35 && ! IsPlayerInAnyVehicle ( playerid ) ) anti_cheat ( playerid, "ФХ", 20 ) ;
		}
		if ( ( strcmp ( animlib, "PARACHUTE", true ) == 0 && strcmp ( animname, "FALl_SKYDIVE_ACCEL", true ) == 0 ) )
		{
			if ( GetPlayerWeapon ( playerid ) != 46 && pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT && get_speed ( playerid ) >= 10 ) anti_cheat ( playerid, "ФХ", 21 ) ;
		}
		if ( strcmp( animlib, "PARACHUTE", true) == 0 && strcmp ( animname, "FALl_SKYDIVE", true ) == 0 )
		{
			if ( GetPlayerWeapon ( playerid ) != 46 && pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT && get_speed ( playerid ) >= 10 ) anti_cheat ( playerid, "ФХ", 21 ) ;
		}*/

		//if ( pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT && ! strcmp ( animname, "CAR_SIT_PRO", true ) ) anti_cheat ( playerid, "метла", 22 ) ;

//		if ( pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT && ! strcmp ( animname, "CAR_SIT_PRO", false ) )
		if ( pl_state == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT && get_speed ( playerid ) >= 250 ) anti_cheat ( playerid, "incorrect speed", 0 ) ;
	}

	if ( p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_reset ] > 0 )
	{
	    p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_reset ] -- ;
	    if ( p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_warnings ] > 0 )
		{
			p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_warnings ] -- ;
			p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_reset ] = 90 ;
		}
	}

	if ( GetTickCount ( ) - p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_update ] < 1000 )
	{
		new pstate = GetPlayerState ( playerid ),
			Float:x, Float:y, Float:z ;
		if ( pstate == PLAYER_STATE_ONFOOT )
		{
			GetPlayerPos ( playerid, x, y, z ) ;
			new Float: dif = GetDistanceBetweenPoints ( x, y, 0.0, p_t_info [ playerid ] [ old_pos ] [ 0 ], p_t_info [ playerid ] [ old_pos ] [ 1 ], 0.0 ),
				Float: difz = floatabs( p_t_info [ playerid ] [ old_pos ] [ 2 ] - z ) ;
			if ( CanWeCheck ( playerid ) )
			{
				new maxdif = ( GetPlayerWeapon( playerid ) == 46 ) ? 40 : 20 ;
				if ( ( dif > maxdif || difz > 75 ) && GetPlayerSurfingVehicleID ( playerid ) == INVALID_VEHICLE_ID )
				{
					if ( dif > 100 )
					{
						//anti_cheat(playerid, "teleport", 819 ) ;
					}
					else
					{
						p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_warnings ] ++ ;
						p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_reset ] = 90 ;
						//anti_cheat ( playerid, "air break", 0 ) ;

						if ( ++ p_t_info [ playerid ] [ ac_warnings ] > 2 )
						{
							anti_cheat ( playerid, "air break", 818 ) ;
						}
					}
				}
				p_t_info [ playerid ] [ old_pos ] [ 0 ] = x ;
				p_t_info [ playerid ] [ old_pos ] [ 1 ] = y ;
				p_t_info [ playerid ] [ old_pos ] [ 2 ] = z ;
			}
		}
