					            SendClientMessage ( i, col_gray, !"{"#cRInfo"}* {"#cGRInfo"}Вы не были допущены до гонки по причине: {"#cRD"}AFK{"#cGRInfo"}." ) ;
					        }
					        else DisableRemoteVehicleCollisions ( i, 1 ) ;
			        	}
				    }
				}
			}
			case 8:
			{
       			StartRace = 2 ;
			    new carid, _player_count = 0 ;
				foreach(new i: logged_players)
				{
				    if ( is_player_race_regged [ i ] )
				    {
				        if ( _player_count > 19 || race_spawn_x [ _player_count ] == 0.0 )
				        {
				            is_player_race_regged [ i ] = false ;
							SendClientMessage ( i, col_yellow, !"* К сожалению, места на гонке закончились." ) ;
				            continue ;
				        }
				    	set_race_pos ( i, race_spawn_x [ _player_count ], race_spawn_y [ _player_count ], race_spawn_z [ _player_count ], race_spawn_a [ _player_count ], 0, 0 ) ;
					    player_race_vehicle [ i ] = CreateVehicle ( RaceVehicle, race_spawn_x [ _player_count ], race_spawn_y [ _player_count ], race_spawn_z [ _player_count ], race_spawn_a [ _player_count ], random ( 126 ), random ( 126 ), -1 ) ;

                        _player_count ++ ;
					    //set_race_pos ( i, race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 0 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 1 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 2 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 3 ], 0, i + 1 ) ;
					    //player_race_vehicle [ i ] = CreateVehicle(RaceVehicle, race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 0 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 1 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 2 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 3 ], random ( 126 ), random ( 126 ), -1 ) ;

						SetVehicleVirtualWorld ( ( carid = player_race_vehicle [ i ] ), 0 ) ;
						PutPlayerInVehicle ( i, carid, 0 ) ;
						TogglePlayerControllable ( i, 0 ) ;
						veh_info [ carid - 1 ] [ v_fuel ] = 100.0 ;
						SendClientMessage ( i, col_yellow, !"* Для выхода из гонки используйте: /exitrace" ) ;
					}
				}
			}
			case 6:
			{
			    new carid, _player_count = 0 ;
				foreach(new i: logged_players)
				{
				    if ( is_player_race_regged [ i ] )
				    {
		    			DestroyVehicle ( player_race_vehicle [ i ], 10 ) ;
					    set_race_pos ( i, race_spawn_x [ _player_count ], race_spawn_y [ _player_count ], race_spawn_z [ _player_count ], race_spawn_a [ _player_count ], 0, i + 1 ) ;
					    player_race_vehicle [ i ] = CreateVehicle ( RaceVehicle, race_spawn_x [ _player_count ], race_spawn_y [ _player_count ], race_spawn_z [ _player_count ], race_spawn_a [ _player_count ], random ( 126 ), random ( 126 ), -1 ) ;

                        _player_count ++ ;
					    //player_race_vehicle [ i ] = CreateVehicle ( RaceVehicle, race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 0 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 1 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 2 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 3 ], random ( 126 ), random ( 126 ), -1 ) ;
						//SetPlayerRaceCheckpoint ( i, 0, race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 0 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 1 ], race_info [ 0 ] [ race_position ] [ 2 ], race_info [ 1 ] [ race_position ] [ 0 ], race_info [ 1 ] [ race_position ] [ 1 ], race_info [ 1 ] [ race_position ] [ 2 ], 10.0);

						SetVehicleVirtualWorld ( ( carid = player_race_vehicle [ i ] ), i + 1 ) ;
						PutPlayerInVehicle ( i, carid, 0 ) ;
						TogglePlayerControllable ( i, 0 ) ;
						veh_info [ carid - 1 ] [ v_fuel ] = 100.0 ;
	                    SetVehicleParamsEx ( carid, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0 ) ;
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}
	return 1 ;
}

stock update_airdrop_label ( )
{
	new fm_string [ 128 ] ;
	if ( airdrop_time == 1 )
	{
		if ( airdrop_owner == -1 )
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{"#cWH"}Неизвестно", air_info [ airdrop_number ] [ lName ] ) ;

		else
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{%s}%s", air_info [ airdrop_number ] [ lName ], f_info [ airdrop_owner - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ airdrop_owner - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
	}
	else
	{
		if ( airdrop_owner == -1 )
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{"#cWH"}Неизвестно\n{"#cWH"}До захвата: {"#cOR"}%d сек.", air_info [ airdrop_number ] [ lName ], airdrop_time ) ;

		else
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{%s}%s\n{"#cWH"}До захвата: {"#cOR"}%d сек.", air_info [ airdrop_number ] [ lName ], f_info [ airdrop_owner - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ airdrop_owner - 1 ] [ f_name ], airdrop_time ) ;
	}
	if ( IsValidDynamic3DTextLabel ( airdrop_label ) ) UpdateDynamic3DTextLabelText ( airdrop_label, col_header_3d, fm_string ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

callback: air_checkin_timer ( )
{
	if ( aidrop_owner_stoped == true )
	{
		KillTimer ( airdrop_timer ) ;
		airdrop_timer = -1 ;
		return 1 ;
	}

	new _fraction_count = 0, _free_fraction = 0, _count_fraction = 0,
		_fraction_id,
		_legal_fraction [ ] = { 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 14, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26 } ;
	for ( new fr_id = 0 ; fr_id < sizeof _legal_fraction ; fr_id ++ )
	{
		_fraction_id = _legal_fraction [ fr_id ] ;
		_fraction_count = 0 ;
		foreach(new i: fraction_players[_fraction_id])
		{
			if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == 0 ) continue ;
			if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] != _fraction_id ) continue ;
			if ( ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( i, airdrop_rectangle ) ) continue ;
			if ( pl_afk_time [ i ] > 30 ) continue ;
			if ( admin_info [ i ] [ admin ] > 0 ) continue ;

			if ( p_info [ i ] [ masked ] > 0 )
			{
				p_info [ i ] [ masked ] = 0 ;
				fraction_color ( i ) ;

				if ( p_info [ i ] [ mask_status ] == 0 ) RemovePlayerAttachedObject ( i, 3 ) ;
			}

			_fraction_count = 1 ;
			break ;
		}

		if ( ! _fraction_count ) continue ;
		if ( _fraction_id >= 4 && _fraction_id <= 9 )
		{
			if ( _free_fraction >= 4 && _free_fraction <= 9 ) continue ;
		}

		_count_fraction ++ ;
		_free_fraction = _fraction_id ;

		if ( _count_fraction > 1 ) break ;
	}

	if ( _count_fraction == 1 )
	{
		if ( airdrop_owner != _free_fraction )
		{
			if ( ( airdrop_owner >= 4 && airdrop_owner <= 9 ) && ( _free_fraction >= 4 && _free_fraction <= 9 ) )
			{
				airdrop_time_stop = false ;
				airdrop_owner = _free_fraction ;
			}
			else
			{
				airdrop_owner = _free_fraction ;
				airdrop_time = 180 ;
				airdrop_time_stop = false ;
			}
		}
		else airdrop_time_stop = false ;
	}
	else if ( _count_fraction == 0 )
	{
		airdrop_owner = -1 ;
		airdrop_time_stop = true ;
		update_airdrop_label ( ) ;
	}
	else
		airdrop_time_stop = true, update_airdrop_label ( ) ;

	return 1 ;
}

stock update_submarine_label ( )
{
	new fm_string [ 128 ] ;

	if ( submarine_number == -1 ) return 1 ;
	if ( submarine_time == 1 )
	{
		if ( submarine_owner == -1 )
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{"#cWH"}Неизвестно", sub_info [ submarine_number ] [ sub_name ] ) ;

		else
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{%s}%s", sub_info [ submarine_number ] [ sub_name ], f_info [ submarine_owner - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ submarine_owner - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
	}
	else
	{
		if ( submarine_owner == -1 )
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{"#cWH"}Неизвестно\n{"#cWH"}До захвата: {"#cOR"}%d сек.", sub_info [ submarine_number ] [ sub_name ], submarine_time ) ;

		else
			format ( fm_string, sizeof fm_string, "** %s **\n\n{%s}%s\n{"#cWH"}До захвата: {"#cOR"}%d сек.", sub_info [ submarine_number ] [ sub_name ], f_info [ submarine_owner - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ submarine_owner - 1 ] [ f_name ], submarine_time ) ;
	}
	if ( IsValidDynamic3DTextLabel ( submarine_label ) ) UpdateDynamic3DTextLabelText ( submarine_label, col_header_3d, fm_string ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

callback: submarine_checkin_timer ( )
{
	if ( submarine_owner_stoped == true )
	{
		KillTimer ( submarine_timer ) ;
		submarine_timer = -1 ;
		return 1 ;
	}

	new _fraction_count = 0, _free_fraction = 0, _count_fraction = 0,
		_fraction_id,
		_legal_fraction [ ] = { 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 14, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26 } ;
	for ( new fr_id = 0 ; fr_id < sizeof _legal_fraction ; fr_id ++ )
	{
		_fraction_id = _legal_fraction [ fr_id ] ;
		_fraction_count = 0 ;
		foreach(new i: fraction_players[_fraction_id])
		{
			if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == 0 ) continue ;
			if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] != _fraction_id ) continue ;
			if ( ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( i, submarine_rectangle ) ) continue ;
			if ( pl_afk_time [ i ] > 30 ) continue ;
			if ( admin_info [ i ] [ admin ] > 0 && admin_info [ i ] [ admin ] < 8 ) continue ;

			if ( p_info [ i ] [ masked ] > 0 )
			{
				p_info [ i ] [ masked ] = 0 ;
				fraction_color ( i ) ;

				if ( p_info [ i ] [ mask_status ] == 0 ) RemovePlayerAttachedObject ( i, 3 ) ;
			}

			_fraction_count = 1 ;
			break ;
		}

		if ( ! _fraction_count ) continue ;
		if ( _fraction_id >= 4 && _fraction_id <= 9 )
		{
			if ( _free_fraction >= 4 && _free_fraction <= 9 ) continue ;
		}

		_count_fraction ++ ;
		_free_fraction = _fraction_id ;

		if ( _count_fraction > 1 ) break ;
	}

	if ( _count_fraction == 1 )
	{
		if ( submarine_owner != _free_fraction )
		{
			if ( ( submarine_owner >= 4 && submarine_owner <= 9 ) && ( _free_fraction >= 4 && _free_fraction <= 9 ) )
			{
				submarine_time_stop = false ;
				submarine_owner = _free_fraction ;
			}
			else
			{
				submarine_owner = _free_fraction ;
				submarine_time = 180 ;
				submarine_time_stop = false ;
			}
		}
		else submarine_time_stop = false ;
	}
	else if ( _count_fraction == 0 )
	{
		submarine_owner = -1 ;
		submarine_time_stop = true ;
		update_submarine_label ( ) ;
	}
	else
		submarine_time_stop = true, update_submarine_label ( ) ;

	return 1 ;
}

stock GetEngineStatus ( vehicleid )
{
	new engine, alarm, doors, bonnet, boot, objective, lights ;
    GetVehicleParamsEx ( vehicleid, engine, lights, alarm, doors, bonnet, boot, objective ) ;
	return engine ;
}

stock GetString ( param1 [ ], param2 [ ] )
{
	return !strcmp ( param1, param2, false ) ;
}

stock GetStringTrue ( param1 [ ], param2 [ ] )
{
	return !strcmp ( param1, param2, true ) ;
}

stock is_text_invalid_sum ( text [ ] )
{
    new length = strlen ( text ) ;

	for ( new i ; i < length ; i ++ )
	{
		switch ( text [ i ] )
		{
			case '0'..'9': continue ;
			default: return 1 ;
		}
	}
	return 0 ;
}

stock is_text_invalid_name ( text [ ] )
{
    new length = strlen ( text ) ;

	for ( new i ; i < length ; i ++ )
	{
		switch ( text [ i ] )
		{
			case 'А'..'Я', 'а'..'я', 'A'..'Z', 'a'..'z', '0'..'9', '_': continue ;
			default: return 1 ;
		}
	}
	return 0 ;
}

stock is_text_invalid ( text [ ] )
{
    new length = strlen ( text ) ;

	for ( new i ; i < length ; i ++ )
	{
		switch ( text [ i ] )
		{
			case 'А'..'Я', 'а'..'я', 'A'..'Z', 'a'..'z', '0'..'9', '_', '@', '.', ',', '[', ']', ' ': continue ;
			default: return 1 ;
		}
	}
	return 0 ;
}

stock is_text_invalid_binder ( text [ ] )
{
    new length = strlen ( text ) ;

	for ( new i ; i < length ; i ++ )
	{
		switch ( text [ i ] )
		{
			case 'А'..'Я', 'а'..'я', 'A'..'Z', 'a'..'z', '0'..'9', '_', '@', '.', ',', '[', ']', ' ', '/': continue ;
			default: return 1 ;
		}
	}
	return 0 ;
}

stock is_text_invalid_promo ( text [ ] )
{
    new length = strlen ( text ) ;

	for ( new i ; i < length ; i ++ )
	{
		switch ( text [ i ] )
		{
			case 'А'..'Я', 'а'..'я', 'A'..'Z', 'a'..'z', '0'..'9', '_', '@', '.', ',', '[', ']', ' ', '#': continue ;
			default: return 1 ;
		}
	}
	return 0 ;
}

stock is_seller_text ( text [ ] )
{
	if(strfind(text, "продам", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "прадам", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "обмен", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "{", true) != -1 && strfind(text, "}", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	return 0 ;
}

stock is_russian_text ( text [ ] )
{
	if(strfind(text, "а", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "б", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "в", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "г", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "д", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "е", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ё", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ж", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "з", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "и", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "й", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "к", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "л", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "м", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "н", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "о", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "п", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "р", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "с", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "т", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "у", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ф", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "х", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ц", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ч", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ш", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "щ", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ъ", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ы", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ь", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "э", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "ю", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	if(strfind(text, "я", true) != -1) return 1 ;
	return 0 ;
}

stock update_int_sql ( playerid, field [ ], data )
{
	new query_string [ 128 ] ;
	format ( query_string, sizeof(query_string), "UPDATE `users` SET `%s` = '%d' WHERE `u_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1", field, data, p_info [ playerid ] [ id ] ) ;
	mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string ) ;
	return true ;
}

stock update_donate_sql ( user_id, data, bool: status )
{
	if ( ! status )
	{
		static const _str [ ] = "UPDATE `user_donation_balance` SET `donation_balance` = `donation_balance` - '%d' WHERE `user_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1" ;
		new query_string [ sizeof _str + ( 9 * 2 ) ] ;
		format ( query_string, sizeof query_string, _str, data, user_id ) ;
		mysql_tquery ( launcher_connection, query_string ) ;
	}
	else
	{
		static const _str [ ] = "UPDATE `user_donation_balance` SET `donation_balance` = `donation_balance` + '%d' WHERE `user_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1" ;
		new query_string [ sizeof _str + ( 9 * 2 ) ] ;
		format ( query_string, sizeof query_string, _str, data, user_id ) ;
		mysql_tquery ( launcher_connection, query_string ) ;
	}
	return true ;
}

stock load_player_donate ( playerid )
{
	static const _str [ ] = "SELECT `donation_balance` FROM `user_donation_balance` WHERE `user_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1" ;
	new query_string [ sizeof _str + 9 ] ;
	format ( query_string, sizeof query_string, _str, p_info [ playerid ] [ launcher ] ) ;
	mysql_tquery ( launcher_connection, query_string, "load_donation_balance", "i", playerid ) ;
	return true ;
}

callback: load_donation_balance ( playerid )
{
	new rows, fields ;
	cache_get_data ( rows, fields ) ;
	printf("[DONATE] Callback load_donation_balance called for playerid %d. Rows: %d", playerid, rows) ;

	if ( rows )
	{
		p_info [ playerid ] [ donate ] = cache_get_field_content_int ( 0, "donation_balance", launcher_connection ) ;
		printf("[DONATE] Loaded donation_balance: %d", p_info [ playerid ] [ donate ]) ;
	}
	else
	{
		p_info [ playerid ] [ donate ] = 0 ;
		printf("[DONATE] No donation balance rows found for playerid %d", playerid) ;
	}
	if ( is_donate_open [ playerid ] ) setUpdateBalance ( playerid, p_info [ playerid ] [ donate ] ) ;

	return true ;
}

stock get_weapon_slot ( weaponid )
{
	switch ( weaponid )
	{
		case 0,1:return 0 ;
		case 2..9:return 1 ;
		case 22..24:return 2 ;
		case 25..27:return 3 ;
		case 28,29,32:return 4 ;
		case 30,31:return 5 ;
		case 33,34:return 6 ;
		case 35..38:return 7 ;
		case 16..18,39:return 8 ;
		case 41..43:return 9 ;
		case 10..15:return 10 ;
		case 44..46:return 11 ;
		case 40:return 12 ;
	}
	return -1 ;
}

stock give_weapon ( playerid, weaponid, ammo )
{
	p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_immune_time ] = 3 ;
	new slot = get_weapon_slot ( weaponid ) ;

	p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_ammo ] [ slot ] += ammo ;
	p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_slot ] [ slot ] = weaponid ;

	GivePlayerWeapon ( playerid, weaponid, ammo ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

stock set_player_ammo ( playerid, weaponid, ammo )
{
	p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_immune_time ] = 3 ;
	new slot = get_weapon_slot ( weaponid ) ;
	p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_ammo ] [ slot ] = ammo ;
	return SetPlayerAmmo ( playerid, weaponid, ammo ) ;
}

stock reset_player_weapon ( playerid )
{
 	for ( new i = 0 ; i < 12 ; i ++ )
    {
        p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_ammo ] [ i ] =
		p_t_info [ playerid ] [ p_gun_slot ] [ i ] = 0 ;
	}
	ResetPlayerWeapons ( playerid ) ;
	return true ;
}

stock RemoveWeaponFromSlot ( playerid, weapon_slot )
{
	new weapons [ 13 ] [ 2 ] ;
	for ( new i = 0 ; i < 13 ; i ++ )
	    GetPlayerWeaponData ( playerid, i, weapons [ i ] [ 0 ], weapons [ i ] [ 1 ] ) ;

	weapons [ weapon_slot ] [ 0 ] =
	weapons [ weapon_slot ] [ 1 ] = 0 ;

	reset_player_weapon ( playerid ) ;

	for ( new i = 0 ; i < 13 ; i ++ )
	    give_weapon ( playerid, weapons [ i ] [ 0 ], weapons [ i ] [ 1 ] ) ;

	return 1 ;
}

stock save_house ( houseid )
{
	global_string [ 0 ] = EOS ;
	format ( global_string, 250, "UPDATE `houses` SET `h_owner` = '%d',`h_closed` = '%d',`h_rent` = '%d',`h_rent_status` = '%d' WHERE `h_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1",
	h_info [ houseid ] [ h_owner ], h_info [ houseid ] [ h_closed ], h_info [ houseid ] [ h_rent_price ], h_info [ houseid ] [ h_rent_status ],
	h_info [ houseid ] [ h_id ] ) ;
	mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, global_string, "", "" ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

stock save_cellar ( houseid )
{
	global_string [ 0 ] = EOS ;
	format ( global_string, 200, "UPDATE `cellars` SET `cl_owner` = '%d',`cl_closed` = '%d' WHERE `cl_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1",
	cellar_info [ houseid ] [ cl_owner ], cellar_info [ houseid ] [ cl_closed ],
	cellar_info [ houseid ] [ cl_id ] ) ;
	mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, global_string, "", "" ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

stock me_action ( playerid, action [ ], Float:distance = 13.0 )
{
	new _t_string [ 128 ] ;
	format ( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), "%s %s", p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], action ) ;
	send_world_message ( playerid, distance, _t_string, col_light_purple, col_light_purple, col_light_purple, false ) ;
	format ( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), "%s", action ) ;
	SetPlayerChatBubble ( playerid, _t_string, col_light_purple, 13, 5000 ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

stock do_action ( playerid, action [ ], Float:distance = 13.0 )
{
	new _t_string [ 128 ] ;
	format( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), "%s (%s)", action, p_info [ playerid ] [  name ] ) ;
	send_world_message ( playerid, distance, _t_string, col_light_purple, col_light_purple, col_light_purple, false ) ;
	SetPlayerChatBubble ( playerid, _t_string, col_light_purple, 13, 5000 ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

stock try_action ( playerid, action [ ], Float:distance = 13.0 )
{
	new luck [ 24 ] ;
	if ( RandomEx(0, 2) == 1 ) strcat ( luck, "{00ff00}Удачно" ) ;
	else strcat ( luck, "{ff7518}Неудачно" ) ;
	new _t_string [ 128 ] ;
	format ( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), "%s %s | %s", p_info [ playerid ] [  name ], action, luck ) ;
	send_world_message ( playerid, distance, _t_string, col_light_purple, col_light_purple, col_light_purple, false ) ;
	format ( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), "%s | %s", action, luck ) ;
	SetPlayerChatBubble ( playerid, _t_string, col_light_purple, 13, 5000 ) ;
	return 1;
}

stock send_world_message ( pointplayerid, Float:max_radius, text[], color1, color2, color3, bool: chat_buble = false )
{
    new Float:distance;
    SendClientMessage ( pointplayerid, color1, text ) ;
    if ( Iter_Count (streamed_players[pointplayerid]) == 0 ) return 1 ;

	new Float:point_x,
		Float:point_y,
		Float:point_z ;
	GetPlayerPos ( pointplayerid, point_x, point_y, point_z ) ;

    foreach ( new i:streamed_players[pointplayerid])
    {
		if ( IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint ( i, max_radius, point_x, point_y, point_z ) && GetPlayerVirtualWorld ( i ) == GetPlayerVirtualWorld ( pointplayerid ) )
        {
            distance = GetPlayerDistanceFromPoint ( i, point_x, point_y, point_z ) ;
            if ( distance >= 0.0 && distance < max_radius / 3 ) SendClientMessage ( i, color1, text ) ;
            if ( distance >= max_radius / 3 && distance < max_radius / 3 * 2 ) SendClientMessage ( i, color2, text ) ;
            if ( distance >= max_radius / 3 * 2 && distance <= max_radius ) SendClientMessage ( i, color3, text) ;
        }
    }
	foreach(new i: admin_players)
	{
		if ( i == pointplayerid ) continue ;
		if ( admin_info [ i ] [ spectate_id ] != -1 )
		{
			if ( IsPlayerInRangeOfPoint ( i, max_radius, point_x, point_y, point_z ) && GetPlayerVirtualWorld ( i ) == GetPlayerVirtualWorld ( pointplayerid ) )
			{
				distance = GetPlayerDistanceFromPoint ( i, point_x, point_y, point_z ) ;
				if ( distance >= 0.0 && distance < 15.0 / 3 )
				{
					if ( p_info [ i ] [ settings ] [ 3 ] )SendClientMessage ( i, color1, text ) ;
					else SendClientMessage ( i, color1, text ) ;
				}
				if ( distance >= 15.0 / 3 && distance < 15.0 / 3 * 2 )
				{
					if ( p_info [ i ] [ settings ] [ 3 ] )SendClientMessage ( i, color2, text ) ;
					else SendClientMessage ( i, color2, text ) ;
				}
				if ( distance >= 15.0 / 3 * 2 && distance <= 25.0 )
				{
					if ( p_info [ i ] [ settings ] [ 3 ] )SendClientMessage ( i, color3, text ) ;
					else SendClientMessage ( i, color3, text ) ;
				}
			}
		}
	}
	if ( chat_buble ) SetPlayerChatBubble ( pointplayerid, text, color1, max_radius, 5000 ) ;
	return 1;
}

stock is_vehicle_occupied ( vehicleid )
{
	foreach(new i: logged_players) if ( IsPlayerInVehicle ( i, vehicleid ) ) return i ;
	//foreach(new i: streamed_in_vehicles[vehicleid]) if ( IsPlayerInVehicle ( i, vehicleid ) ) return i ;
	return -1 ;
}

callback: spawn_cars ( playerid )
{
	for ( new c = 1 ; c < MAX_VEHICLES ; c ++ )
	{
		if ( is_vehicle_occupied ( c ) != -1 ) continue ;
		if ( GetVehicleModel ( c ) == 450 ) continue ;
		SetVehicleToRespawn ( c, 2 ) ;
	}

	static const _str [ ] = "Администратор %s обновил весь незанятый транспорт." ;
	new _t_string [ sizeof _str + MAX_PLAYER_NAME ] ;
	format ( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), _str, p_info [ playerid ] [ name ] ) ;
	foreach(new i: logged_players) SendClientMessage ( i, col_light_red, _t_string ) ;
	return true ;
}

