						score_kill, f_info [ mw_owner - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], mw_attacker_points,
						mw_owner_points, f_info [ mw_attacker - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
					}

                    new _fraction_id ;
					foreach(new i: logged_players)
					{
					    if ( ! mafia_player ( i ) && ! admin_info [ i ] [ admin_settings ] [ 1 ] ) continue ;

						SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, killerid, playerid, reason ) ;

						_fraction_id = p_info [ i ] [ member ] ;
						if ( admin_info [ i ] [ admin_settings ] [ 1 ] ) _fraction_id = mw_owner ;

						if ( ( f_diplomacy [ mw_owner - 18 ] [ _fraction_id - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance || is_control_chat { i } == mw_owner || _fraction_id == mw_owner ||
							f_diplomacy [ mw_attacker - 18 ] [ _fraction_id - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance || is_control_chat { i } == mw_attacker || _fraction_id == mw_attacker ) && p_info [ i ] [ settings ] [ 0 ] != 0 ) SendClientMessage ( i, f_info [ mw_owner - 1 ] [ f_radar_color ], scm_string ) ;

						if ( player_device { i } == 2 ) showBizWar ( i ) ;
						else { }
					}

					#if defined m_fractions
					    give_emp_progress ( killerid, 0, 1 ) ;
					#endif

					checking_mafia_quest_progress ( killerid, 2, 1 ) ;
				}
			}
		}
	}

	if ( gz_captured != -1 )
	{
		if ( ( IsPlayerInGangZone ( playerid, gz_captured ) || ( IsPlayerInRangeOfQuad ( playerid, gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_pos ] [ 2 ], gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_pos ] [ 3 ] ) < 200 || IsPlayerInRangeOfQuad ( playerid, gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_pos ] [ 0 ], gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_pos ] [ 1 ] ) < 200 ) ) && gang_player ( playerid ) && gang_player ( killerid ) && p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] != p_info [ playerid ] [ member ] )
		{
	        new killerfrac = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ], playerfrac = p_info [ playerid ] [ member ] ;
		    if ( gang_player ( playerid ) && gang_player ( killerid ) && killerfrac != playerfrac )
		    {
				if ( killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] ||
				    killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance ||
					f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war ||
					f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war )
				{
					if ( gz_capture_type == gz_type_kills )
					{
						new score_kill, query_string [ 98 ], scm_string [ 144 ], td_string [ 48 ] ;
						switch ( reason )
						{
							case 0 									: score_kill += 5 ;
							case 22, 23 							: score_kill += 4 ;
							case 5, 6, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15	: score_kill += 10 ;
							default 								: score_kill += 1 ;
						}

						attacker_points += score_kill ;

						format ( query_string,sizeof ( query_string ), "UPDATE `fractions_players` SET `u_capture_kills` = `u_capture_kills`+1 WHERE `u_sql_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1", p_info [ killerid ] [ id ] ) ;
						mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string, "", "" ) ;

						checking_getto_quest_progress ( killerid, 2, 1 ) ;

						p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ++ ;
						if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_status ] > 1 && p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] > 0 && p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_death ] > 0 )
						{
							format ( query_string, 8, "%d", p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( killerid, capture_ptd [ killerid ] [ 5 ], query_string ) ;

							new Float: _kda = floatdiv ( p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ], p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_death ] ) ;
					    	if ( _kda < 0 ) _kda = 0.0 ;

							format ( query_string, 16, "K/D:_%.2f", _kda ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( killerid, capture_ptd [ killerid ] [ 7 ], query_string ) ;
						}
						if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] > capture_kills_two )
						{
                            capture_kills_two = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
                            format ( capture_kills_two_name, 32, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
						}

						p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_death ] ++ ;
						if ( p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_status ] > 1 && p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_kills ] > 0 && p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_death ] > 0 )
						{
						    new Float: _kda = floatdiv ( p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_kills ], p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_death ] ) ;
					    	if ( _kda < 0 ) _kda = 0.0 ;

							format ( query_string, 16, "K/D:_%.2f", _kda ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( playerid, capture_ptd [ playerid ] [ 7 ], query_string ) ;
						}

						if ( zahvat_kills [ 0 ] < p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] )
					    {
					        zahvat_fractions [ 0 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] ;
						    zahvat_kills [ 0 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
						    format ( zahvat_names [ 0 ], MAX_PLAYER_NAME, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
				   		}
					    else if ( zahvat_kills [ 1 ] < p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] )
					    {
					     	zahvat_fractions [ 1 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] ;
						    zahvat_kills [ 1 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
						    format ( zahvat_names [ 1 ], MAX_PLAYER_NAME, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
				   		}
					    else if ( zahvat_kills [ 2 ] < p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] )
					    {
						    zahvat_fractions [ 2 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] ;
						    zahvat_kills [ 2 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
						    format ( zahvat_names [ 2 ], MAX_PLAYER_NAME, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
					    }

						if ( killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [%s] завалил(а) %s [%s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], attacker_points,
							owner_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

						else if ( killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [%s] завалил(а) %s [Альянс с %s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], attacker_points,
							owner_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

						else if ( f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [Альянс с %s] завалил(а) %s [%s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], attacker_points,
							owner_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

						else if ( f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [Альянс с %s] завалил(а) %s [Альянс с %s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], attacker_points,
							owner_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

                        new _fraction_id ;
						foreach(new i: logged_players)
						{
						    if ( ! gang_player ( i ) && ! admin_info [ i ] [ admin_settings ] [ 0 ] ) continue ;

							SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, killerid, playerid, reason ) ;

                            _fraction_id = p_info [ i ] [ member ] ;
							if ( admin_info [ i ] [ admin_settings ] [ 1 ] ) _fraction_id = gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] ;

							if ( ( ( f_diplomacy [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] [ _fraction_id - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance || is_control_chat { i } == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] || _fraction_id == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] ) ||
							( f_diplomacy [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] [ _fraction_id - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance || is_control_chat { i } == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] || _fraction_id == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] ) ) && p_info [ i ] [ settings ] [ 0 ] != 0 ) SendClientMessage ( i, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_radar_color ], scm_string ) ;

							format ( td_string, sizeof td_string, "%d", attacker_points ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, capture_ptd [ i ] [ 4 ], td_string ) ;

							if ( p_info [ i ] [ capture_status ] > 2 )
							{
								format ( td_string, sizeof td_string, "%s", capture_kills_two_name ) ;
								PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, capture_ptd [ i ] [ 9 ], td_string ) ;
							}
						}

                        checking_getto_quest_progress ( killerid, 2, 1 ) ;
					}
				}
				if ( killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] ||
				    killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ]  && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance ||
					f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war ||
					f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war )
				{
					if ( gz_capture_type == gz_type_kills )
					{
						new score_kill, query_string [ 98 ], scm_string [ 144 ], td_string [ 48 ] ;
						switch ( reason )
						{
							case 0 									: score_kill += 5 ;
							case 22, 23 							: score_kill += 4 ;
							case 5, 6, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15	: score_kill += 10 ;
							default 								: score_kill += 1 ;
						}

						owner_points += score_kill ;

						format ( query_string,sizeof(query_string),"UPDATE `fractions_players` SET `u_capture_kills` = `u_capture_kills`+1 WHERE `u_sql_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1", p_info [ killerid ] [ id ] ) ;
						mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string, "", "" ) ;

						checking_getto_quest_progress ( killerid, 2, 1 ) ;

						p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ++ ;
						if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_status ] > 1 && p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] > 0 && p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_death ] > 0 )
						{
							format ( query_string, 8, "%d", p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( killerid, capture_ptd [ killerid ] [ 5 ], query_string ) ;

							new Float: _kda = floatdiv ( p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ], p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_death ] ) ;
					    	if ( _kda < 0 ) _kda = 0.0 ;

							format ( query_string, 16, "K/D:_%.2f", _kda ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( killerid, capture_ptd [ killerid ] [ 7 ], query_string ) ;
						}
						if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] > capture_kills_first )
						{
                            capture_kills_first = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
                            format ( capture_kills_first_name, 32, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
						}

						p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_death ] ++ ;
						if ( p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_status ] > 1 && p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_kills ] > 0 && p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_death ] > 0 )
						{
						    new Float: _kda = floatdiv ( p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_kills ], p_info [ playerid ] [ capture_death ] ) ;
					    	if ( _kda < 0 ) _kda = 0.0 ;

							format ( query_string, 16, "K/D:_%.2f", _kda ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( playerid, capture_ptd [ playerid ] [ 7 ], query_string ) ;
						}

						if ( zahvat_kills [ 0 ] < p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] )
					    {
					        zahvat_fractions [ 0 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] ;
						    zahvat_kills [ 0 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
						    format ( zahvat_names [ 0 ], MAX_PLAYER_NAME, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
				   		}
					    else if ( zahvat_kills [ 1 ] < p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] )
					    {
					     	zahvat_fractions [ 1 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] ;
						    zahvat_kills [ 1 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
						    format ( zahvat_names [ 1 ], MAX_PLAYER_NAME, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
				   		}
					    else if ( zahvat_kills [ 2 ] < p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] )
					    {
						    zahvat_fractions [ 2 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] ;
						    zahvat_kills [ 2 ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ capture_kills ] ;
						    format ( zahvat_names [ 2 ], MAX_PLAYER_NAME, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
					    }

						if ( killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [%s] завалил(а) %s [%s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], owner_points,
							attacker_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

						else if ( killerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [%s] завалил(а) %s [Альянс с %s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], owner_points,
							attacker_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

						else if ( f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && playerfrac == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [Альянс с %s] завалил(а) %s [%s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], owner_points,
							attacker_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

						else if ( f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [  gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ playerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance && f_diplomacy [ killerfrac - 18 ] [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] == dip_status_war )
						{
							format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[U] %s [Альянс с %s] завалил(а) %s [Альянс с %s] (+%d очков). Счёт: %s [%d] : [%d] %s",
							p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ],
							score_kill, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ], owner_points,
							attacker_points, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_letter_name ] ) ;
						}

                        new _fraction_id ;
						foreach(new i: logged_players)
						{
						    if ( ! gang_player ( i ) && ! admin_info [ i ] [ admin_settings ] [ 0 ] ) continue ;

							SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, killerid, playerid, reason ) ;

                            _fraction_id = p_info [ i ] [ member ] ;
							if ( admin_info [ i ] [ admin_settings ] [ 1 ] ) _fraction_id = gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] ;

							if ( ( ( f_diplomacy [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 18 ] [ _fraction_id - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance || is_control_chat { i } == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] || _fraction_id == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] ) ||
							( f_diplomacy [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] - 18 ] [ _fraction_id - 18 ] == dip_status_alliance || is_control_chat { i } == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] || _fraction_id == gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_attacker ] ) ) && p_info [ i ] [ settings ] [ 0 ] != 0 ) SendClientMessage ( i, f_info [ gz_info [ gz_captured ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_radar_color ], scm_string ) ;

                            format ( td_string, sizeof td_string, "%d", owner_points ) ;
							PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, capture_ptd [ i ] [ 3 ], td_string ) ;

							if ( p_info [ i ] [ capture_status ] > 2 )
							{
								format ( td_string, sizeof td_string, "%s", capture_kills_first_name ) ;
								PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, capture_ptd [ i ] [ 8 ], td_string ) ;
							}
						}

						checking_getto_quest_progress ( killerid, 2, 1 ) ;
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}

	if ( p_t_info [ killerid ] [ tr_team ] != 0 && p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_team ] != 0 )
	{
	    if ( p_t_info [ killerid ] [ tr_team ] != p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_team ] )
 		{
			new score_kill, scm_string [ 144 ], td_string [ 48 ],
				_team_id = p_t_info [ killerid ] [ tr_team ] - 1,
				_fraction_id = p_t_info [ killerid ] [ tr_enter ] ;
			switch ( reason )
			{
				case 0 									: score_kill += 5 ;
				case 22, 23 							: score_kill += 4 ;
				case 5, 6, 7, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15	: score_kill += 10 ;
				default 								: score_kill += 1 ;
			}

			score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ _team_id ] += score_kill ;

			p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] ++ ;
			if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ training_status ] > 1 && p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] > 0 && p_info [ killerid ] [ training_death ] > 0 )
			{
				format ( td_string, 8, "%d", p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] ) ;
				PlayerTextDrawSetString ( killerid, training_ptd [ killerid ] [ 5 ], td_string ) ;

				new Float: _kda = floatdiv ( p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ], p_info [ killerid ] [ training_death ] ) ;
				if ( _kda < 0 ) _kda = 0.0 ;

				format ( td_string, 16, "K/D:_%.2f", _kda ) ;
				PlayerTextDrawSetString ( killerid, training_ptd [ killerid ] [ 7 ], td_string ) ;
			}
			if ( _team_id == 0 )
			{
				if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] > training_kills_first )
				{
	                 training_kills_first = p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] ;
	                 format ( training_kills_first_name, 32, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
				}
			}
			else
			{
				if ( p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] > training_kills_two )
				{
	                 training_kills_two = p_info [ killerid ] [ training_kills ] ;
	                 format ( training_kills_two_name, 32, "%s", p_info [ killerid ] [ name ] ) ;
				}
			}

			p_info [ playerid ] [ training_death ] ++ ;
			if ( p_info [ playerid ] [ training_status ] > 1 && p_info [ playerid ] [ training_kills ] > 0 && p_info [ playerid ] [ training_death ] > 0 )
			{
			    new Float: _kda = floatdiv ( p_info [ playerid ] [ training_kills ], p_info [ playerid ] [ training_death ] ) ;
				if ( _kda < 0 ) _kda = 0.0 ;

				format ( td_string, 16, "K/D:_%.2f", _kda ) ;
				PlayerTextDrawSetString ( playerid, training_ptd [ playerid ] [ 7 ], td_string ) ;
			}

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
			    if ( p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_enter ] != p_t_info [ i ] [ tr_enter ] ) continue ;

				SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, killerid, playerid, reason ) ;

				if ( p_t_info [ killerid ] [ tr_team ] == p_t_info [ i ] [ tr_team ] )
				{
					format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[TRAINING] %s [YOU TEAM] завалил(а) %s [RIVAL] (+%d очков). Счёт: YOU TEAM [%d] : [%d] RIVAL",
					p_info [ killerid ] [ name ],
					p_info [ playerid ] [ name ],
					score_kill, score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ _team_id ],
					score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_team ] - 1 ] ) ;
					SendClientMessage ( i, 0xb5e8f0FF, scm_string ) ;
				}
				else
				{
					format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, "[TRAINING] %s [RIVAL] завалил(а) %s [YOU TEAM] (+%d очков). Счёт: RIVAL [%d] : [%d] YOU TEAM",
					p_info [ killerid ] [ name ],
					p_info [ playerid ] [ name ],
					score_kill, score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ _team_id ],
					score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_team ] - 1 ] ) ;
					SendClientMessage ( i, 0xb5e8f0FF, scm_string ) ;
				}

				format ( td_string, 8, "%d", score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ 0 ] ) ;
				PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, training_ptd [ i ] [ 3 ], td_string ) ;

				format ( td_string, 8, "%d", score_tr_team [ _fraction_id ] [ 1 ] ) ;
				PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, training_ptd [ i ] [ 4 ], td_string ) ;

				if ( p_info [ i ] [ training_status ] > 2 )
				{
					format ( td_string, sizeof td_string, "%s", training_kills_first_name ) ;
					PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, training_ptd [ i ] [ 8 ], td_string ) ;

					format ( td_string, sizeof td_string, "%s", training_kills_two_name ) ;
					PlayerTextDrawSetString ( i, training_ptd [ i ] [ 9 ], td_string ) ;
				}
			}
		}
	}

	if ( p_info [ playerid ] [ wanted ] > 0 )
	{
	    if ( army_player ( killerid ) )
	    {
			#if defined m_fractions
			    give_emp_progress ( playerid, 3, 1 ) ;
			#endif
	    }
		else if ( ( cop_player ( killerid ) || fbi_player ( killerid ) ) && p_info [ killerid ] [ rank ] > 4 &&
					! reload_police_warning ( killerid ) && is_fraction_duty { killerid } == 1 )
		{
  			if ( mw_biz == -1 && gz_captured == -1 && zones_captured == -1 && conf_time == 0 && TeamPaint [ playerid ] == 0 &&
				duel_opponent [ playerid ] == INVALID_PLAYER_ID && boxing_opponent [ playerid ] == INVALID_PLAYER_ID &&
				! player_mp [ playerid ] && ! p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_team ] && player_duel [ playerid ] [ duel_in_lobby ] == INVALID_PLAYER_ID )
		    {
			    if ( ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( killerid, family_airdrop_rectangle ) && ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( killerid, family_dealer_rectangle ) &&
					! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( playerid, family_airdrop_rectangle ) && ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( playerid, family_dealer_rectangle ) )
			    {
					p_info [ playerid ] [ jailed ] = ( ( p_info [ playerid ] [ wanted ] * 10 ) * 60 ) ;

					#if defined m_prison
					    p_info [ playerid ] [ jail ] = 9 ;
					#else
						if ( cop_player ( killerid ) ) p_info [ playerid ] [ jail ] = p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] - 3 ;
						else if ( fbi_player ( killerid ) ) p_info [ playerid ] [ jail ] = 1 ;
					#endif

					p_info [ playerid ] [ wanted ] = 0 ;
					SetPlayerWantedLevel ( playerid, p_info [ playerid ] [ wanted ] ) ;

					#if defined m_fractions
					    give_emp_progress ( killerid, 3, 1 ) ;
					#endif

					SendClientMessage( playerid, col_light_red, !"Вы были посажены в камеру." ) ;

					new query_string [ 128 ] ;
					format ( query_string, sizeof query_string, "UPDATE `users` SET `u_wanted` = '0', `u_jail` = '%d' WHERE `u_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1",
					p_info [ playerid ] [ jail ], p_info [ playerid ] [ id ] ) ;
					mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string ) ;

					format(query_string, sizeof(query_string), "[Внимание] %s %s (%s) нейтрализовал(а) преступника %s.", f_rank [ p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] - 1 ] [ p_info [ killerid ] [ rank ] - 1 ], p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], f_info [ p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] - 1 ] [ f_name ], p_info [ playerid ] [ name ] ) ;
					foreach(new i : logged_players)
					{
						if ( cop_player ( i ) || fbi_player ( i ) ) SendClientMessage ( i, col_light_red, query_string ) ;
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}

	if ( ! cop_player ( killerid ) && ! fbi_player ( killerid ) && ! army_player ( killerid ) && ! prison_player ( killerid ) )
	{
	    if ( mw_biz == -1 && gz_captured == -1 && zones_captured == -1 && conf_time == 0 && TeamPaint [ playerid ] == 0 &&
			duel_opponent [ playerid ] == INVALID_PLAYER_ID && boxing_opponent [ playerid ] == INVALID_PLAYER_ID &&
			! player_mp [ playerid ] && ! p_t_info [ playerid ] [ tr_team ] && player_duel [ playerid ] [ duel_in_lobby ] == INVALID_PLAYER_ID )
	    {
		    if ( ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( killerid, family_airdrop_rectangle ) && ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( killerid, family_dealer_rectangle ) &&
				! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( playerid, family_airdrop_rectangle ) && ! IsPlayerInDynamicArea ( playerid, family_dealer_rectangle ) )
	        {
				if ( cop_player ( playerid ) ) suspect_player ( killerid, "Убийство полицейского", 4 ) ;
				else if ( fbi_player ( playerid ) ) suspect_player ( killerid, "Убийство агента ФБР", 5 ) ;
				else if ( army_player ( playerid ) ) suspect_player ( killerid, "Убийство военного", 3 ) ;
				else if ( ! cop_player ( playerid ) && ! fbi_player ( playerid ) && ! army_player ( playerid ) ) suspect_player ( killerid, "Убийство человека", 2 ) ;
			}
		}
	}

	if ( c_info [ killerid ] [ c_id ] != INVALID_PLAYER_ID )
	{
	    new hitman_id = c_info [ killerid ] [ c_id ] ;
	    if ( killerid == c_info [ playerid ] [ c_player ] )
		{
		    static const _str [ ] = "[F] %s %s[%d] выполнил(а) заказ." ;
			new scm_string [ sizeof _str + 32 + 24 + 4 ] ;
			format ( scm_string, sizeof scm_string, _str, f_rank [ p_info [ killerid ] [ member ] - 1 ] [ p_info [ killerid ] [ rank ] - 1 ], p_info [ killerid ] [ name ], killerid ) ;
			fraction_message ( p_info [ killerid ] [ member ], col_lblue, scm_string ) ;

			give_money ( killerid, p_info [ hitman_id ] [ head_value ] ) ;
            insert_money_log ( killerid, INVALID_PLAYER_ID, p_info [ hitman_id ] [ head_value ], "контракт" ) ;

            p_info [ hitman_id ] [ head_value ] = 0 ;
			update_int_sql ( hitman_id, "u_head_value", 0 ) ;

			if ( p_t_info [ killerid ] [ c_gangzone ] != -1 )
		    {
		      	GangZoneHideForPlayer ( killerid, p_t_info [ killerid ] [ c_gangzone ] ) ;
		        GangZoneDestroy ( p_t_info [ killerid ] [ c_gangzone ] ) ;
				p_t_info [ killerid ] [ c_gangzone ] = -1 ;
		    }

			#if defined m_fractions
			    give_emp_progress ( killerid, 4, 1 ) ;
			#endif

			c_info [ killerid ] [ c_id ] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID ;
			c_info [ hitman_id ] [ c_player ] = INVALID_PLAYER_ID ;
		}
	}
	return 1 ;
}

stock ProxDetectorS ( Float: radi, playerid, targetid )
{
	if ( IsPlayerConnected ( playerid ) && IsPlayerConnected ( targetid ) )
	{
		if ( GetPlayerVirtualWorld ( playerid ) == GetPlayerVirtualWorld ( targetid ) )
		{
			new Float: posx, Float: posy, Float: posz,
				Float: olsposx, Float: olsposy, Float: olsposz,
				Float: tempposx, Float: tempposy, Float: tempposz ;
			GetPlayerPos ( playerid,  olsposx,  olsposy,  olsposz ) ;
			GetPlayerPos ( targetid, posx, posy, posz ) ;
			tempposx = ( olsposx -posx) ;
			tempposy = ( olsposy -posy) ;
			tempposz = ( olsposz -posz) ;
			if ( ( (tempposx < radi ) && ( tempposx > -radi ) ) && ( ( tempposy < radi ) && ( tempposy > -radi ) ) && ( ( tempposz < radi ) && ( tempposz > -radi ) ) )
			{
				return true ;
			}
		}
	}
	return false ;
}

stock GetBoatDoorPos ( vehicleid, &Float:x, &Float:y, &Float:z )
{
	new Float:v_angle,
		Float:v_distance_d,
		Float:v_distance_a ;

	switch ( GetVehicleModel ( vehicleid ) )
	{
		case 454:x = -0.6802, y = -2.6828, z = 0.8636 ;
		case 446:x = -0.1356, y = 0.9229, z = 1.6700 ;
		case 484:x = -0.0601, y = -1.4653, z = 1.6859 ;
		case 493:x = -0.6802, y = -2.6828, z = 0.8636 ;
	}
    x += 0.20 ;



	v_distance_d = floatsqroot ( ( x * x ) + ( y * y ) ) ;
    v_distance_a = atan2 ( x, y ) ;


    GetVehicleZAngle ( vehicleid, v_angle ) ;
    GetVehiclePos ( vehicleid, x, y, z ) ;
	x += v_distance_d * floatsin ( v_distance_a - v_angle, degrees ) ;
	y += v_distance_d * floatcos ( v_distance_a - v_angle, degrees ) ;
    return 1 ;
}

stock v_boat_int ( vehicleid )
{
	switch ( veh_info [ vehicleid - 1 ] [ v_model ] )
	{
		case 454, 446, 484, 493: return true ;
	}
	return false ;
}

Float:GetAngle(Float:x, Float:y, Float:ix, Float:iy)
{
	new Float:absoluteangle, Float:tmpangle, Float:misc = 5.0;
    tmpangle = 180.0 - atan2(x-ix,y-iy);
    tmpangle += misc;
    misc *= -1;
    absoluteangle = tmpangle + misc;
    return absoluteangle;
}

stock IsPlayerFacingCoords(playerid, Float:destx, Float:desty, offset = 0)
{
        new Float:px, Float:py, Float:pz, Float:a, Float:a2;
        GetPlayerPos(playerid, px, py, pz);
        GetPlayerFacingAngle(playerid, a);
        a2 = GetAngle(px, py, destx, desty);
        if((a2 + offset) > 360) a2 = 360 - offset;
        if((a2 - offset) < 0) a2 = 0 + offset;
        if(a < (a2 + offset) && a > (a2 - offset)) return 1;
        return 0;
}

